摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A DeepSeek Harness web UI plugin for customizing and managing the settings navigation drawer. DeepSeek Harness 设置抽屉插件，用于自定义和管理设置页左侧导航栏，可隐藏/显示各设置栏目，修改即时生效。","id":"gh:1337528952","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-settings-drawer","slug":"zizhongfeiyang/dsh-settings-drawer","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness web UI plugin for customizing and managing the settings navigation drawer. DeepSe"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ek Harness 设置抽屉插件，用于自定义和管理设置页左侧导航栏，可隐藏/显示各设置栏目，修改即时生效。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Settings Drawer (`dsh-settings-drawer`)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness web UI plugin that lets you choose which settings sections, plugin tabs, and plug"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"in configuration entries appear."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Unchecking an item hides its entry immediately. Core pages (General, Models, Plugins, Agent Presets,"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" Account) stay visible by default. Hiding an entry does not disable its plugin."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文说明"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The screenshot shows 1.2.0; 1.3.0 groups the live entries by surface."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- Hide or show any settings section from the left navigation.\n- Changes apply immediately and persis"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"t in your browser.\n- Discovers live `settings.section`, `settings.plugins.tab`, and `plugins.item` c"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ontributions, including new DSH 0.2 plugin configuration entries.\n- Removed plugins no longer linger"},{"id":"p9s4","text":": the list only shows currently registered sections.\n- Manual refresh (`⟳`) re-syncs the list withou"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"t deleting preferences for temporarily unloaded plugins.\n- Core settings pages, including Account, s"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"tay visible by default; new plugin tabs and configuration entries also start visible.\n- Disabling or"},{"id":"p9s7","text":" unloading the drawer restores the original registry and releases subscriptions.\n- No dependency on "},{"id":"p9s8","text":"generated CSS class names or DOM mutation observers.\n- Pure client-side UI plugin — no extra service"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"s, no network calls."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"From GitHub:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Official DSH 0.2 Desktop uses the `desktop` profile. Install the bundled `dsh` command through the a"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"pp's **Manage dsh command** menu, initialize Desktop by opening it once, then fully quit the app bef"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"e dsh command** menu, initialize Desktop by opening it once, then fully quit the app before running:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Use Desktop's bundled command for that profile; an npm-installed `dsh` cannot manage it. Older EAC d"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"istributions may still use `web-desktop`; select the profile your distribution actually runs. See th"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"e official Desktop command instructions."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"From a locally packed or release tarball:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"For Desktop tarballs, use `--profile desktop` with the bundled command. After installing, restart De"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"sktop or the Web service and reload the page. When upgrading from 1.2.0, a full page reload or app r"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"estart is required to remove that version's unmanaged observer and registry wrapper."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"1. Open **Settings**.\n2. Open **设置抽屉** (Settings Drawer) at the top of the left nav.\n3. Uncheck item"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"s in **设置栏目**, **插件标签**, or **插件配置项**. The corresponding entry disappears immediately. Groups with n"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"o registered entries are omitted.\n4. **只显示核心项** retains the core sections, the `all` plugin tab, and"},{"id":"p20s4","text":" the built-in Shell, Agent Loop, Subagent, and Web Search configuration entries. **恢复默认** clears sav"},{"id":"p20s5","text":" Shell, Agent Loop, Subagent, and Web Search configuration entries. **恢复默认** clears saved overrides."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Item | Value |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| npm package name | `dsh-settings-drawer` |\n| UI display name | 设置抽屉 / Settings Drawer |\n| localSto"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"rage key | `dsh_settings_drawer_config_v2` |\n| Default visible sections | General, Models, Plugins, "},{"id":"p23s3","text":"Agent Presets, Account, and the legacy `dock` / `dsh-prompt` entries |\n| New plugin surfaces | Visib"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"le by default; independent `visiblePluginTabs` and `visiblePluginItems` maps |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"1.2.0's `enableDrawer` and `visibleCards` values are retained under the same storage key. Explicit c"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"hoices, including hiding a core page, are preserved. Unregistered entries disappear from the list wi"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"thout losing saved preferences."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Tested with"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- 1.3.0: automated integration checks using the published DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 SlotRegistry/Cordis and Rea"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ct components, plus the published 0.1.0-rc.7 SlotCore contract.\n- Historical 1.2.0 manual checks: DS"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"H 0.1.0-rc.6 / rc.7, EAC 3.0.1 / 4.1.0, and Chrome-based Windows Web UI."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The 1.3.0 tests exercise registration, filtering, configuration migration, live updates, storage eve"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"nts, and unload/re-enable behavior. They do not boot a complete Desktop app or run a browser end-to-"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"unload/re-enable behavior. They do not boot a complete Desktop app or run a browser end-to-end test."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The legacy peer option is needed only for the two pinned test fixtures' different DSH peer contracts"},{"id":"p30s2","text":". Test dependencies are development-only and are not bundled into the installed plugin."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The package contains:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- `lib/index.js` — host entry\n- `lib/client.js` — browser client\n- `cordis.patch.yml` — bundle patch"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"\n- `README.md`, `README.zh.md`"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Feedback"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Found a bug or have a feature request? Open an issue and use the provided templates."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
